{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stacking Up: A World in Progress</strong>\u00a0is a casual physics stacking game. A new world turtle hatchling named Topple is in need of a world to carry. A desktop globe has caught his eye, and he needs your help to get to it. Stack items from start to finish in order to help Topple get to his globe and start his journey of carrying his own world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the stack!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday objects become your building blocks. Stack, balance, and improvise your way from the starting area to the goal, finding stability in the chaos of clutter. Make sure your tower holds for at least 3 seconds to complete the level and help Topple to learn how to balance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/cea64e9412ef5afbfad1495eb3348a61.poster.avif?t=1762381366\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/cea64e9412ef5afbfad1495eb3348a61.webm?t=1762381366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack Everywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is this globe so hard to get to? Due to some unforeseen events it keeps on running away. Help Topple get to it by stacking anything you can find. Explore each room with their own unique challenges and hazards, 13 stages with over 90 levels combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/40a59bfcf20cd412d7a5cddc3a7d9d78.poster.avif?t=1762381366\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/40a59bfcf20cd412d7a5cddc3a7d9d78.webm?t=1762381366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To the Stars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topple is a world turtle hatchling destined to carry his own planet one day... probably. Before he can do that he'll need to actually find a world to carry. Help him on his quest by completing stages to unlock the story of Topple's journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/extras/1f4730815515e921f0f82f103a6430c3.avif?t=1762381366\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Different stages, each with their own items and unique hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of over 90 different levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi backing tracks\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple solutions to each stack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A funny, lighthearted story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtles</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133190?t=1762381366","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133190?t=1762381366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133190/6cd13e6c0cbab0ab217c8d4aa218a2c294d26b4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762381366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/